  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新增了「進食動畫」與「暮光森林」模組食物物品，以及暮光森林主題擴展中的部分變體之間的相容性。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>材質包相容性</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進食動畫更多模組相容性材質包 [NEO/FORGE]</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>其他部分相容性：</strong></em></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_65ecc468-d6a5-423e-ac32-fbe1473e2593.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_7267a975-bbd6-4866-b7d0-204852d47d23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223426/description_279b593b-ff8e-4bf2-9f54-fdc3f6ea86b0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1529/920/638993640361607660.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1772/708/639126112161736473.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><strong>為模組新增與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進食動畫 (NEO/FORGE)</a> & <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(FABRIC)</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modefite</a> 的相容性</strong></p><h3><strong>模組相容性：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">[分支]</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光風味與佳餚</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光盛宴</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwilight-forest-artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林遺物</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>相容版本：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>1.16.x，</strong><strong>1.17.x，</strong><strong>1.18.x，</strong><strong>1.19.x，</strong><strong>1.20.x，</strong><strong>1.21.x</strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1523334/description_7e4c4d0e-3aa1-44f0-b69e-bf6cce403daf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"648\" height=\"378\"></strong></p><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
